{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1392119-questions-about-emergent-legacy-in-signs-of-sorcery","id":1392119,"title":"Questions about Emergent Legacy in Signs of Sorcery","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-27T22:11:49-07:00","id":1392119,"title":"Questions about Emergent Legacy in Signs of Sorcery","content":"I've been playing a long running campaign off and on that started in Ascension, went through Awakening 1st into 2nd, and my character has been an ex Technocrat current Virtual Adept. Well there been some rough transitions shoehorning my tech ideas into Awakening, especially Legacy wise. And then in Signs of Sorcery pg 111, I saw The Emergent. They sound like a Moros lineage with possible Space as a new Ruling? Any info or insights into the subject because I really like the idea. Also, I have been playing around with making a futuristic Proximi line, possibly tied into the Emergent, Some opinions on the matter would be much appreciated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Things need not have happened to be true. Tales and dreams are the shadow truths that will endure when mere facts are dust and ashes, and forgot.&quot; Sandman (Neil Gaiman)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/733-troller","name":"Troller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T01:05:05-07:00","id":1392439,"title":"","content":"Hard to say since the description is pretty vague. The singularity that's being referred to is supposed to be a post-human kind of thing, it's speculated it can involve uploading people's minds to computers or the internet. Going from that and the things the legacy is interested in it strikes me as a Mind/Forces legacy whose members ultimate goal is to abandon their bodies in favor of &quot;better&quot; ones, or simply to exist online.<br /> <br /> Could be Space and Matter instead though, sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T06:59:47-07:00","id":1392502,"title":"","content":"It may be germane to point out that the Singularity is an Emanation Realm of Time \u2014 it's the same place introduced in Imperial Mysteries:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Singularity (Arcadia, Time \u2014 Archetype of Progress): An endless city crawls south down its nameless river, adding new districts to symbolize the dreams of human progress. In the desolate north you can find the kingdom of Prester John. The densely populated southern districts contain strict caliphates, towers ruled by cyborg Libertarians, and other would-be utopias. Careful travelers sometimes discover clues about the past and future of the mundane world in objects, places and conversations between its inhabitants. They usually appear human and possessed of a shallow, fanatical idealism. They work furiously; each society is <u>almost</u> perfect. Irises to the Temenos may be found here. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T08:04:04-07:00","id":1392534,"title":"","content":"Nice context.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-29T10:24:25-07:00","id":1392588,"title":"","content":"I think the problem is asking &quot;What is the Singularity ?&quot;. Its not defined at all. Is it the Arcadian Emanation or something else entirely ?<br /> <br /> Is it the Correspondence point in the illusionary universe style of paradigm of the Virtual Adepts ? They mention they control technology and teleporting, so that makes you think about Remote Control and Co-Location.<br /> <br /> The problem is that a technomagic Legacy calling themselves Emergent is probably a reference to emergent behavior in algorithms, which can be defined as simple rules acting as building blocks that allow for complex and unexpected applications. But what does that mean ? <br /> <br /> One interpretation is that they create a type of quantum entanglement, linking all technologies into an unhackable and zero lag network. Maybe binding spirits to spontaneously power and control them. At high levels, you could make neuromods from Prey, allowing users to gain spirit powers by reverse Claiming quasi-spirit implants, thus achieving the Singularity with technology. But that would make them a Matter and Spirit Legacy.<br /> <br /> In the end, we have too little data to do much more than guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 05-29-2020, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-17T17:34:35-07:00","id":1505616,"title":"","content":"I know its bad form Necroing an old thread, but since I started the thread and the question is relevant I figured let me just promote it here. Does anyone know who wrote the Legacies and Emanations portion in Signs of Sorcery? I'd love to try to pick their brain.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Emergent, who dream of impossible technologies<br /> and mind-expanding memes from the Singularity, realm<br /> of Progress. The Emergent summon magical technologies<br /> and travel through the Singularity as digitized<br /> soul-information, to command electronic devices around<br /> the world.\u200b&quot;<br /> <br /> Key phrases like 'Impossible Technologies', 'Mind-Expanding Memes', 'Summon Magical Technologies', and 'Digitized Soul-Information', give me a number of clues. Seems like it might hew towards Mastigos with the words summon and mind memes. On a stretch maybe Moros with the digitized soul, but Mind seems more appropriate then Death. The technology and electronic devices might point to the Ruling being Matter or Forces. Either way I'd love to know more about the writers insights on this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Things need not have happened to be true. Tales and dreams are the shadow truths that will endure when mere facts are dust and ashes, and forgot.&quot; Sandman (Neil Gaiman)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/733-troller","name":"Troller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-17T18:58:28-07:00","id":1505622,"title":"","content":"They sound like they are Astral Projecting through the internet, increasing their intelligence, controlling machinery. It suggests Forces and Mind, but the themes sound more like an Obrimos Legacy (bringing forth the glorious potential of impossible technologies) rather than a Mastigos one. I imagine they would be very close to the <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/889501-2e-legacy-mentats\">Mentats</a> that proindrakenzol wrote a while ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-17-2023, 10:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}